    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Centre of English Language at Aga Khan University will host a two-day seminar on the theme 'Language, Culture and Identity: Issues and Challenges' on July 16-17, 2005. Dr Hamida Khuhro, Minister for Education and Literacy, Government of Sindh, will be the chief guest on the occasion.",
